# Build context for backend/Dockerfile. The image gets code, the evaluation results and the split
# manifests only: datasets, weights and credentials are mounted or kept out (see README, "Docker").
*
!backend/
!src/
!requirements.txt
!requirements-backend.txt
!reports/final_results.md
!reports/results/
!data/manifests/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
